==== positive tier=fast
CONSTANTS
    GroupCount = 3
    HotGroup = 1
    BuggyTickHot = FALSE
    BuggyReadyHot = FALSE
SPECIFICATION FairSpec
INVARIANTS
    BoundedTickGap
    BoundedReadyGap
PROPERTIES
    TickEventuallyEach
    ReadyEventuallyEach

==== BadTickHot
CONSTANTS
    GroupCount = 3
    HotGroup = 1
    BuggyTickHot = TRUE
    BuggyReadyHot = FALSE
SPECIFICATION Spec
INVARIANT BoundedTickGap

==== BadReadyHot
